00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The screen fades in to reveal the D-District Prison, a massive dark industrial complex rising from a barren, desolate landscape.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The prison is a towering cylindrical structure with multiple horizontal levels stacked vertically. Its concrete exterior is weathered and imposing.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The structure is surrounded by endless sand dunes and barren wasteland extending to the horizon. Guard towers with powerful searchlights are positioned at intervals around the perimeter.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Below the main structure, armored military vehicles patrol the sandy approaches. Soldiers in uniform move throughout the compound.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Searchlights sweep across the landscape in a rhythmic pattern. The atmosphere is entirely bleak and oppressive, conveying a sense of inescapable confinement and military control.
